{"page":124,"width":1832,"height":2942,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"178","words":[{"text":"178","x":204,"y":163,"width":63,"height":31}]},{"text":"Chapter 4 스레드외 병행성","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":346,"y":166,"width":136,"height":32},{"text":"4","x":497,"y":169,"width":24,"height":23},{"text":"스레드외","x":554,"y":169,"width":101,"height":28},{"text":"병행성","x":666,"y":170,"width":73,"height":29}]},{"text":"제를 해결해야 하는 프로그래머는 병렬로 실행되는 솔루션을 설계히여 최신 니중 고이","words":[{"text":"제를","x":348,"y":310,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"해결해야","x":436,"y":310,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"하는","x":594,"y":311,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"프로그래머는","x":680,"y":309,"width":213,"height":42},{"text":"병렬로","x":911,"y":310,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"실행되는","x":1034,"y":310,"width":144,"height":42},{"text":"솔루션을","x":1194,"y":310,"width":149,"height":42},{"text":"설계히여","x":1361,"y":312,"width":147,"height":43},{"text":"최신","x":1532,"y":312,"width":73,"height":43},{"text":"니중","x":1624,"y":312,"width":71,"height":42},{"text":"고이","x":1710,"y":323,"width":56,"height":47}]},{"text":"시스템의 성능을 활용할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"시스템의","x":348,"y":377,"width":138,"height":42},{"text":"성능을","x":504,"y":378,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"활용할","x":622,"y":378,"width":106,"height":41},{"text":"수","x":739,"y":378,"width":37,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":791,"y":377,"width":75,"height":41}]},{"text":"4.1.2 장점 Benefits","words":[{"text":"4.1.2","x":346,"y":506,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"장점","x":515,"y":505,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"Benefits","x":609,"y":514,"width":135,"height":25}]},{"text":"다중 스레드 프로그래밍의 이점은 다음의 4가지 큰 부류로 니눌 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"다중","x":347,"y":589,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"스레드","x":430,"y":589,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"프로그래밍의","x":550,"y":588,"width":209,"height":43},{"text":"이점은","x":777,"y":589,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"다음의","x":896,"y":589,"width":103,"height":43},{"text":"4가지","x":1015,"y":591,"width":89,"height":42},{"text":"큰","x":1121,"y":594,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"부류로","x":1170,"y":592,"width":111,"height":42},{"text":"니눌","x":1296,"y":592,"width":74,"height":42},{"text":"수","x":1383,"y":592,"width":38,"height":42},{"text":"있다.","x":1437,"y":592,"width":82,"height":41}]},{"text":"1. 응답성(responsiveness): 대화형 핑용을 디중 스레드화히편 응용 프로그램의 일","words":[{"text":"1.","x":380,"y":699,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"응답성(responsiveness):","x":434,"y":693,"width":417,"height":48},{"text":"대화형","x":872,"y":694,"width":101,"height":43},{"text":"핑용을","x":994,"y":696,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"디중","x":1120,"y":696,"width":72,"height":42},{"text":"스레드화히편","x":1209,"y":696,"width":223,"height":42},{"text":"응용","x":1451,"y":696,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"프로그램의","x":1546,"y":698,"width":177,"height":43},{"text":"일","x":1742,"y":709,"width":24,"height":40}]},{"text":"부른이 봉쇄되거나, 응용 프로그램이 긴 작업을 수행하더라도 프로그램의 수행이","words":[{"text":"부른이","x":435,"y":762,"width":102,"height":42},{"text":"봉쇄되거나,","x":558,"y":762,"width":187,"height":44},{"text":"응용","x":763,"y":763,"width":72,"height":43},{"text":"프로그램이","x":851,"y":765,"width":174,"height":42},{"text":"긴","x":1049,"y":765,"width":31,"height":41},{"text":"작업을","x":1100,"y":765,"width":109,"height":42},{"text":"수행하더라도","x":1225,"y":765,"width":226,"height":43},{"text":"프로그램의","x":1469,"y":766,"width":186,"height":41},{"text":"수행이","x":1675,"y":768,"width":89,"height":49}]},{"text":"계속되는 것을 허용함으로써, 시용자에 대한 응답성을 증가시킨다. 이 특징은 사용","words":[{"text":"계속되는","x":437,"y":832,"width":141,"height":41},{"text":"것을","x":592,"y":832,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"허용함으로써,","x":678,"y":833,"width":220,"height":42},{"text":"시용자에","x":914,"y":834,"width":140,"height":42},{"text":"대한","x":1072,"y":834,"width":71,"height":42},{"text":"응답성을","x":1155,"y":835,"width":149,"height":41},{"text":"증가시킨다.","x":1318,"y":834,"width":198,"height":42},{"text":"이","x":1536,"y":833,"width":31,"height":42},{"text":"특징은","x":1587,"y":835,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"사용","x":1709,"y":838,"width":58,"height":45}]},{"text":"자 인터페이스를 설계하는 데 있어 특히 유용하다. 예를 들어 사용자가 시간이 많","words":[{"text":"자","x":436,"y":901,"width":36,"height":41},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":489,"y":900,"width":212,"height":42},{"text":"설계하는","x":717,"y":902,"width":141,"height":42},{"text":"데","x":874,"y":902,"width":30,"height":41},{"text":"있어","x":926,"y":903,"width":65,"height":42},{"text":"특히","x":1010,"y":904,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"유용하다.","x":1097,"y":904,"width":154,"height":42},{"text":"예를","x":1273,"y":904,"width":73,"height":41},{"text":"들어","x":1361,"y":904,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"사용자가","x":1454,"y":902,"width":154,"height":42},{"text":"시간이","x":1624,"y":904,"width":98,"height":42},{"text":"많","x":1740,"y":912,"width":28,"height":41}]},{"text":"이 걸리는 연산을 시작하는 단추를 클릭했을 때 어떻게 되는지 생각해 보자. 단일","words":[{"text":"이","x":437,"y":970,"width":29,"height":41},{"text":"걸리는","x":488,"y":970,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"연산을","x":610,"y":970,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"시작하는","x":731,"y":970,"width":141,"height":42},{"text":"단추를","x":886,"y":971,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"클릭했을","x":1010,"y":972,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"때","x":1172,"y":973,"width":31,"height":41},{"text":"어떻게","x":1225,"y":973,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"되는지","x":1352,"y":973,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"생각해","x":1481,"y":971,"width":112,"height":42},{"text":"보자.","x":1613,"y":972,"width":79,"height":41},{"text":"단일","x":1709,"y":975,"width":58,"height":47}]},{"text":"스레드 공정은 그 연산이 완료될 때까지 사용자에게 응답하지 않을 것이다. 대조적","words":[{"text":"스레드","x":435,"y":1040,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"공정은","x":554,"y":1039,"width":109,"height":42},{"text":"그","x":674,"y":1046,"width":37,"height":27},{"text":"연산이","x":726,"y":1039,"width":99,"height":41},{"text":"완료될","x":842,"y":1039,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"때까지","x":965,"y":1040,"width":101,"height":42},{"text":"사용자에게","x":1085,"y":1040,"width":180,"height":43},{"text":"응답하지","x":1281,"y":1042,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"않을","x":1449,"y":1041,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"것이다.","x":1540,"y":1041,"width":119,"height":41},{"text":"대조적","x":1677,"y":1041,"width":88,"height":49}]},{"text":"으로 시간이 오래 걸리는 연산이 별도의 비동기적 스레드에서 실행된다면 핑펑은","words":[{"text":"으로","x":435,"y":1112,"width":73,"height":32},{"text":"시간이","x":524,"y":1109,"width":100,"height":43},{"text":"오래","x":645,"y":1108,"width":67,"height":42},{"text":"걸리는","x":733,"y":1108,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"연산이","x":855,"y":1107,"width":100,"height":43},{"text":"별도의","x":978,"y":1109,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"비동기적","x":1103,"y":1109,"width":140,"height":43},{"text":"스레드에서","x":1264,"y":1111,"width":183,"height":41},{"text":"실행된다면","x":1470,"y":1110,"width":188,"height":42},{"text":"핑펑은","x":1674,"y":1109,"width":94,"height":48}]},{"text":"여전히 사용자에게 응답할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"여전히","x":438,"y":1178,"width":101,"height":43},{"text":"사용자에게","x":557,"y":1177,"width":172,"height":43},{"text":"응답할","x":744,"y":1177,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"수","x":862,"y":1177,"width":37,"height":41},{"text":"있다.","x":914,"y":1177,"width":77,"height":42}]},{"text":"2. 자원 공유(resource sharing): 프로세스는 공유 메모리와 메시지 전달 기법을 통","words":[{"text":"2.","x":380,"y":1254,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"자원","x":437,"y":1249,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"공유(resource","x":523,"y":1249,"width":235,"height":44},{"text":"sharing):","x":774,"y":1250,"width":157,"height":45},{"text":"프로세스는","x":949,"y":1249,"width":182,"height":41},{"text":"공유","x":1145,"y":1250,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"메모리와","x":1236,"y":1250,"width":151,"height":42},{"text":"메시지","x":1402,"y":1250,"width":108,"height":42},{"text":"전달","x":1533,"y":1249,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"기법을","x":1625,"y":1247,"width":103,"height":42},{"text":"통","x":1739,"y":1254,"width":28,"height":40}]},{"text":"하여만 자원을 공유할수 있다. 이러한 기법은 프로그래머에 의해 명시적으로 처리","words":[{"text":"하여만","x":438,"y":1318,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"자원을","x":558,"y":1317,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"공유할수","x":675,"y":1316,"width":157,"height":42},{"text":"있다.","x":847,"y":1316,"width":75,"height":42},{"text":"이러한","x":941,"y":1317,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"기법은","x":1062,"y":1317,"width":108,"height":42},{"text":"프로그래머에","x":1183,"y":1320,"width":221,"height":41},{"text":"의해","x":1423,"y":1320,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"명시적으로","x":1513,"y":1318,"width":183,"height":42},{"text":"처리","x":1710,"y":1319,"width":54,"height":45}]},{"text":"되어야 한다. 그러나 스레드는 지동으로 그들이 속한 프로세스의 자원들과 메모리","words":[{"text":"되어야","x":440,"y":1386,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"한다.","x":560,"y":1386,"width":78,"height":40},{"text":"그러나","x":654,"y":1385,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"스레드는","x":776,"y":1386,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"지동으로","x":932,"y":1386,"width":144,"height":41},{"text":"그들이","x":1091,"y":1387,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"속한","x":1216,"y":1388,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1305,"y":1389,"width":185,"height":41},{"text":"자원들과","x":1510,"y":1386,"width":151,"height":43},{"text":"메모리","x":1676,"y":1386,"width":88,"height":45}]},{"text":"를 공유한다. 코드와 데이터 공유의 이점은 한 핑용 프로그램이 같은 주소 공간 내","words":[{"text":"를","x":439,"y":1455,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"공유한다.","x":488,"y":1454,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"코드와","x":653,"y":1453,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"데이터","x":775,"y":1454,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"공유의","x":894,"y":1454,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"이점은","x":1018,"y":1455,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"한","x":1139,"y":1455,"width":37,"height":39},{"text":"핑용","x":1188,"y":1456,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"프로그램이","x":1277,"y":1457,"width":184,"height":41},{"text":"같은","x":1481,"y":1457,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"주소","x":1571,"y":1458,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"공간","x":1660,"y":1454,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"내","x":1741,"y":1459,"width":23,"height":41}]},{"text":"에 여러 개의 다른 작업을 하는 스레드를 가질 수 있다는 점이다.","words":[{"text":"에","x":442,"y":1520,"width":31,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":490,"y":1521,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"개의","x":572,"y":1521,"width":65,"height":41},{"text":"다른","x":654,"y":1520,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"작업을","x":736,"y":1521,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"하는","x":856,"y":1522,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"스레드를","x":939,"y":1522,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"가질","x":1097,"y":1523,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":1181,"y":1524,"width":38,"height":40},{"text":"있다는","x":1234,"y":1524,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"점이다.","x":1357,"y":1525,"width":120,"height":42}]},{"text":"3. 경제성(economy): 프로세스 생성을 위해 메모리와 자원을 할당하는 것은 비용이","words":[{"text":"3.","x":385,"y":1593,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"경제성(economy):","x":442,"y":1588,"width":302,"height":48},{"text":"프로세스","x":762,"y":1590,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"생성을","x":918,"y":1590,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"위해","x":1043,"y":1591,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"메모리와","x":1130,"y":1592,"width":147,"height":40},{"text":"자원을","x":1289,"y":1592,"width":114,"height":40},{"text":"할당하는","x":1418,"y":1593,"width":151,"height":41},{"text":"것은","x":1586,"y":1592,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"비용이","x":1675,"y":1592,"width":88,"height":44}]},{"text":"많이 든다. 스레드는 자신이 속한 프로세스의 자원들을 공유하기 때문에, 스레드를","words":[{"text":"많이","x":442,"y":1656,"width":66,"height":41},{"text":"든다.","x":525,"y":1657,"width":78,"height":41},{"text":"스레드는","x":619,"y":1658,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"자신이","x":773,"y":1658,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"속한","x":893,"y":1658,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"프로세스의","x":979,"y":1658,"width":177,"height":42},{"text":"자원들을","x":1173,"y":1659,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"공유하기","x":1333,"y":1661,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"때문에,","x":1500,"y":1660,"width":120,"height":41},{"text":"스레드를","x":1636,"y":1659,"width":131,"height":44}]},{"text":"생성하고 문맥 교환하는 것이 더욱더 경제적이다. 오버헤드의 차이를 경험적으로","words":[{"text":"생성하고","x":441,"y":1725,"width":143,"height":42},{"text":"문맥","x":599,"y":1727,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"교환하는","x":686,"y":1726,"width":142,"height":41},{"text":"것이","x":845,"y":1726,"width":65,"height":41},{"text":"더욱더","x":933,"y":1727,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"경제적이다.","x":1058,"y":1727,"width":187,"height":41},{"text":"오버헤드의","x":1264,"y":1727,"width":183,"height":42},{"text":"차이를","x":1469,"y":1728,"width":113,"height":41},{"text":"경험적으로","x":1600,"y":1727,"width":167,"height":40}]},{"text":"측정하는 것은 어려울 수 있지만 일반적으로 스레드 생성은 프로세스 생성보다 시","words":[{"text":"측정하는","x":441,"y":1793,"width":144,"height":41},{"text":"것은","x":600,"y":1794,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"어려울","x":685,"y":1794,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"수","x":802,"y":1795,"width":36,"height":40},{"text":"있지만","x":855,"y":1795,"width":105,"height":41},{"text":"일반적으로","x":976,"y":1795,"width":178,"height":40},{"text":"스레드","x":1168,"y":1796,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"생성은","x":1291,"y":1795,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스","x":1418,"y":1796,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"생성보다","x":1584,"y":1794,"width":141,"height":42},{"text":"시","x":1738,"y":1798,"width":24,"height":41}]},{"text":"간과 메모리를 덜 소비한다. 또한 문맥 교환은 일반적으로 프로세스 사이보다 스레","words":[{"text":"간과","x":443,"y":1861,"width":73,"height":42},{"text":"메모리를","x":528,"y":1862,"width":141,"height":41},{"text":"덜","x":683,"y":1862,"width":32,"height":40},{"text":"소비한다.","x":729,"y":1862,"width":149,"height":41},{"text":"또한","x":894,"y":1863,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"문맥","x":979,"y":1863,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"교환은","x":1065,"y":1864,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"일반적으로","x":1189,"y":1863,"width":180,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스","x":1382,"y":1865,"width":151,"height":40},{"text":"사이보다","x":1546,"y":1863,"width":148,"height":41},{"text":"스레","x":1705,"y":1866,"width":58,"height":41}]},{"text":"드 사이에서 더 빠르다.","words":[{"text":"드","x":444,"y":1934,"width":36,"height":28},{"text":"사이에서","x":493,"y":1930,"width":137,"height":41},{"text":"더","x":648,"y":1930,"width":29,"height":41},{"text":"빠르다.","x":694,"y":1930,"width":112,"height":41}]},{"text":"4. 규모 적응성(scalability): 다중 스레드의 이점은 다중 처리기 구조에서 더욱 증가","words":[{"text":"4.","x":390,"y":2000,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"규모","x":445,"y":2000,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"적응성(scalability):","x":533,"y":1998,"width":320,"height":47},{"text":"다중","x":871,"y":1998,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"스레드의","x":958,"y":1999,"width":138,"height":41},{"text":"이점은","x":1117,"y":1999,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"다중","x":1239,"y":1999,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"처리기","x":1329,"y":2000,"width":104,"height":42},{"text":"구조에서","x":1454,"y":2000,"width":146,"height":42},{"text":"더욱","x":1622,"y":2000,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"증가","x":1705,"y":2003,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"할 수 있다. 다중 처리기 구조에서는 각각의 스레드가 다른 처리기에서 병렬로 수","words":[{"text":"할","x":447,"y":2065,"width":38,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":497,"y":2065,"width":37,"height":41},{"text":"있다.","x":552,"y":2066,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"다중","x":645,"y":2066,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"처리기","x":731,"y":2066,"width":99,"height":41},{"text":"구조에서는","x":850,"y":2067,"width":179,"height":41},{"text":"각각의","x":1044,"y":2067,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"스레드가","x":1166,"y":2067,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"다른","x":1328,"y":2068,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"처리기에서","x":1419,"y":2069,"width":180,"height":41},{"text":"병렬로","x":1622,"y":2068,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":1737,"y":2070,"width":29,"height":40}]},{"text":"행될 수 있기 때문이다. 단일 스레드 프로세스는 처리기가 아무리 많더라도 오직","words":[{"text":"행될","x":450,"y":2133,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":537,"y":2135,"width":36,"height":40},{"text":"있기","x":592,"y":2134,"width":63,"height":41},{"text":"때문이다.","x":677,"y":2135,"width":147,"height":40},{"text":"단일","x":842,"y":2134,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"스레드","x":930,"y":2135,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1054,"y":2135,"width":180,"height":40},{"text":"처리기가","x":1252,"y":2135,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"아무리","x":1415,"y":2137,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"많더라도","x":1544,"y":2136,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"오직","x":1706,"y":2138,"width":56,"height":39}]},{"text":"한 처리기에서만 실행된다. 다음 절에서 이 쟁점에 대해 자세히 검토한다.","words":[{"text":"한","x":451,"y":2202,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"처리기에서만","x":501,"y":2202,"width":211,"height":42},{"text":"실행된다.","x":725,"y":2202,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"다음","x":886,"y":2202,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"절에서","x":971,"y":2202,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"이","x":1090,"y":2203,"width":29,"height":40},{"text":"쟁점에","x":1137,"y":2202,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"대해","x":1258,"y":2202,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"자세히","x":1342,"y":2203,"width":106,"height":41},{"text":"검토한다.","x":1468,"y":2203,"width":155,"height":41}]},{"text":"4.2 다중 코어 프로그래밍 Multicore Programming","words":[{"text":"4.2","x":223,"y":2431,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":371,"y":2430,"width":81,"height":48},{"text":"코어","x":465,"y":2432,"width":80,"height":40},{"text":"프로그래밍","x":564,"y":2431,"width":200,"height":47},{"text":"Multicore","x":800,"y":2441,"width":179,"height":29},{"text":"Programming","x":993,"y":2441,"width":268,"height":35}]},{"text":"컴퓨터 설계의 역사 초기에 더 좋은 컴퓨팅 성능에 대한 요구에 부응하여 단일 CPU 시","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터","x":371,"y":2536,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"설계의","x":491,"y":2537,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"역사","x":614,"y":2537,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"초기에","x":696,"y":2536,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"더","x":816,"y":2535,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"좋은","x":862,"y":2535,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"컴퓨팅","x":949,"y":2534,"width":96,"height":41},{"text":"성능에","x":1065,"y":2534,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"대한","x":1184,"y":2535,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"요구에","x":1267,"y":2535,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"부응하여","x":1391,"y":2536,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"단일","x":1553,"y":2535,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"CPU","x":1642,"y":2539,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"시","x":1740,"y":2536,"width":25,"height":39}]},{"text":"스템은 다중 CPU 시스템으로 발전하였다. 나중의 비슷한 시스템 설계 추세는 단일 컴","words":[{"text":"스템은","x":368,"y":2603,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"다중","x":492,"y":2604,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"CPU","x":578,"y":2607,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"시스템으로","x":681,"y":2603,"width":175,"height":41},{"text":"발전하였다.","x":872,"y":2601,"width":181,"height":41},{"text":"나중의","x":1070,"y":2601,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"비슷한","x":1192,"y":2601,"width":106,"height":41},{"text":"시스템","x":1314,"y":2601,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"설계","x":1440,"y":2603,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"추세는","x":1528,"y":2603,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"단일","x":1656,"y":2602,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"컴","x":1741,"y":2602,"width":24,"height":39}]},{"text":"퓨팅 집에 여러 컴퓨팅 코어를 배치하는 것이다. 각 코어는 운영체제에 별도의 CPU로","words":[{"text":"퓨팅","x":369,"y":2668,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"집에","x":457,"y":2669,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":544,"y":2670,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"컴퓨팅","x":632,"y":2670,"width":100,"height":41},{"text":"코어를","x":752,"y":2669,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"배치하는","x":874,"y":2669,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"것이다.","x":1030,"y":2668,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"각","x":1158,"y":2668,"width":36,"height":40},{"text":"코어는","x":1208,"y":2668,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제에","x":1329,"y":2668,"width":181,"height":42},{"text":"별도의","x":1531,"y":2668,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"CPU로","x":1656,"y":2672,"width":113,"height":32}]}]}